Source: neurodraw
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Maintainer: ros2neuro PPA <forin.paolo98@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cmake, pkg-config, libsdl2-dev, libsdl2-image-dev, libsdl2-ttf-dev, libgl-dev
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: libneurodraw2
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: 2D graphics library for BCI feedback (runtime)
 neurodraw is a compact C++ graphics library for 2D neurofeedback and BCI
 interfaces built on SDL2 and OpenGL. This package contains the shared
 libraries neurodraw and neurochrono.

Package: libneurodraw-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Depends: libneurodraw2 (= ${binary:Version}), libsdl2-dev, libsdl2-image-dev, libsdl2-ttf-dev, libgl-dev, ${misc:Depends}
Description: 2D graphics library for BCI feedback (development files)
 Headers and CMake package files (find_package(neurodraw CONFIG)) for neurodraw
 and neurochrono.
